---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Spare Parts Supply & Support" description="Genuine OEM and certified aftermarket parts, delivered from Dubai to your port." nav="services" page="service-spare-parts" mainClass="svc-detail">

  <section class="hero page ph-service sd-hero">
    <div class="hero-inner"><div class="wrap sd-grid">
      <div class="rise">
        <span class="tag">Service 3 of 8</span>
        <h1>Spare Parts Supply &amp; Support</h1>
        <p class="sub">Genuine OEM and certified aftermarket parts, delivered to your port.</p>
      </div>
    </div></div>
  </section>
  <div class="body">
    <div class="wrap sd-wrap">
      <nav class="crumbs"><a href="/services/">← All services</a><span>/</span><b>Spare Parts Supply &amp; Support</b></nav>
      
      <div class="sd-top reveal">
        <figure class="sd-pic plate">
          <img src="/images/svc-spares.jpg" style="object-position: 50% 50%" alt="Spare Parts Supply &amp; Support">
          
        </figure>
        <section class="sd-block first">
          <h4><span>1</span>What we do</h4>
          <p>We specialize in the end-to-end supply, procurement and logistical delivery of high-quality spare parts for ships and boats. Leveraging our licensed operations in Dubai, we provide an exhaustive inventory of mission-critical components, from main engine propulsion and auxiliary machinery to deck equipment and specialized electrical systems, keeping your vessels at peak operational readiness.</p>
          
        </section>
      </div>
      
      <section class="sd-block reveal">
        <h4><span>2</span>Why partner with us</h4>
        
        
        <p>Partnering with us means securing a reliable supply chain that minimizes costly vessel downtime and off-hire penalties. We combine technical expertise, rigorous quality assurance and strategic regional logistics to deliver genuine OEM and certified aftermarket parts right to your port or bunkering location. Our round-the-clock response and commitment to strict material traceability make us the trusted partner your fleet can depend on for smooth, uninterrupted voyages.</p>
      </section>
      
      <nav class="sd-pn">
        <a href="/services/shipyard-agent/"><span class="k">← Previous</span><span class="t">Shipyards Agent &amp; Representative</span></a>
        <a class="sd-all btn dark plate" href="/services/">All services</a>
        <a class="r" href="/services/engineering/"><span class="k">Next →</span><span class="t">Engineering Consultancy in Shipbuilding</span></a>
      </nav>
      <div class="sd-talk plate reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Talk to our team</span>
        <h3>Interested in Spare Parts Supply &amp; Support?</h3>
        <p>Tell us about your vessel or project and we'll come back with a clear plan.</p>
        <a class="btn plate" href="/contact/">Enquire now <span class="ar">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
